{"a1":[{"k":"title","cap":"Best Contiguous Sum","say":"Let's solve Best Contiguous Sum, using the Sliding Window (Kadane) approach.","card":{"title":"Best Contiguous Sum","sub":"Sliding Window (Kadane) · Medium","pattern":"sliding-window"}},{"k":"problem","cap":"Return the largest sum of any non-empty contiguous subarray of nums.","card":{"lines":["Return the largest sum of any non-empty contiguous subarray of nums."]}},{"k":"example","cap":"For example, with nums = [-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4], the answer is 6. [4, -1, 2, 1] sums to 6.","say":"For example, with nums equals -2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4, the answer is 6. 4, -1, 2, 1 sums to 6.","card":{"lines":["Input: nums = [-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4]","Output: 6","[4, -1, 2, 1] sums to 6."]}},{"k":"idea","cap":"Grow the window to the right and keep its sum. If the sum before adding nums[right] is negative, that prefix only drags things down, so restart the window: left jumps to right.","say":"Grow the window to the right and keep its sum. If the sum before adding nums at right is negative, that prefix only drags things down, so restart the window: left jumps to right.","card":{"pattern":"sliding-window","name":"Sliding Window"}},{"k":"idea","cap":"The best window sum seen at any point is the answer. This is Kadane's algorithm seen as a sliding window.","card":{"pattern":"sliding-window","name":"Sliding Window"}},{"k":"trace","cap":"Let's walk through it with nums = [-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4].","say":"Let's walk through it with nums equals -2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4.","st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":0},{"l":"right","i":0}],"w":[0,0]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"-2"},{"k":"best","v":"-2"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"Add -2. The window sum is -2.","say":"Add -2. The window sum is minus 2.","ln":{"python":6,"java":6},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":0},{"l":"right","i":0}],"w":[0,0]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"-2"},{"k":"best","v":"-2"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window sum went negative, so restart the window at index 1.","ln":{"python":5,"java":5},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":1},{"l":"right","i":1}],"w":[1,1]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"0"},{"k":"best","v":"-2"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"Add 1. The window sum is 1.","ln":{"python":6,"java":6},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":1},{"l":"right","i":1}],"w":[1,1]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"1"},{"k":"best","v":"-2"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"Add -3. The window sum is -2.","say":"Add -3. The window sum is minus 2.","ln":{"python":6,"java":6},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":1},{"l":"right","i":2}],"w":[1,2]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"-2"},{"k":"best","v":"1"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window sum went negative, so restart the window at index 3.","ln":{"python":5,"java":5},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":3},{"l":"right","i":3}],"w":[3,3]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"0"},{"k":"best","v":"1"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"Add 4. The window sum is 4.","ln":{"python":6,"java":6},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":3},{"l":"right","i":3}],"w":[3,3]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"4"},{"k":"best","v":"1"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"Add -1. The window sum is 3.","ln":{"python":6,"java":6},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":3},{"l":"right","i":4}],"w":[3,4]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"3"},{"k":"best","v":"4"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"Add 2. The window sum is 5.","ln":{"python":6,"java":6},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":3},{"l":"right","i":5}],"w":[3,5]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"5"},{"k":"best","v":"4"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"Add 1. The window sum is 6.","ln":{"python":6,"java":6},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":3},{"l":"right","i":6}],"w":[3,6]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"6"},{"k":"best","v":"5"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"Add -5. The window sum is 1.","ln":{"python":6,"java":6},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":3},{"l":"right","i":7}],"w":[3,7]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"1"},{"k":"best","v":"6"}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"Add 4. The window sum is 5.","ln":{"python":6,"java":6},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":3},{"l":"right","i":8}],"w":[3,8]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"5"},{"k":"best","v":"6"}]}},{"k":"done","cap":"The answer is 6.","st":{"arrays":[{"n":"nums","v":["-2","1","-3","4","-1","2","1","-5","4"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":3},{"l":"right","i":8}],"w":[3,8]}],"vars":[{"k":"total","v":"5"},{"k":"best","v":"6"}]}},{"k":"complexity","cap":"Time complexity is O(n) and extra space is O(1).","say":"Time complexity is O of n and extra space is O of one.","card":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)"}},{"k":"outro","cap":"That's the Sliding Window (Kadane) approach. Now try writing it yourself, in Java or Python!"}]}